奏免秀官，詔曰：「不能使人之不加諸我，此古人所難。交關人事，詡之罪耳，豈尚書令能防乎！其勿有所問。」司隸校尉李憙復上言，騎都尉劉尚為尚書令裴秀占官稻田，求禁止秀。詔又以秀幹翼朝政，有勳績於王室，不可以小疵掩大德，使推正尚罪而解秀禁止焉。","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p005:m0085"]}],"rationale":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008","text":"今天下自服化以來，方漸八年，雖側席求賢，不遺幽賤，然臣不爾推有德，達有功，使聖聽知勝臣者多，未達者不少。假令有遺德於版築之下，有隱才于屠釣之間，而朝議用臣不以為非，臣處之不以為愧，所失豈不大哉！臣忝竊雖久，未若今日兼文武之極寵，等宰輔之高位也。且臣雖所見者狹，據今光祿大夫李憙執節高亮，在公正色；光祿大夫魯芝潔身寡欲，和而不同；光祿大夫李胤清亮簡素，立身在朝，皆服事華髮，以禮終始。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cys_s5z_uqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"李憙","kind":"person","person_id":"3vy_cjq_eco","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p008:m0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"魯芝","kind":"person","person_id":"p2q_m63_1jq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu-comparison:p0